  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759202,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1000cc Turbo - A Blazing Amiga Racer\n\nPrepare for high-octane thrills in *1000cc Turbo*, a blistering motorbike racing game for the Commodore Amiga!  Choose your weapon – a powerful Enduro or a sleek Road Bike – and tear across challenging tracks, battling formidable opponents in a relentless pursuit of victory. The game delivers a visceral arcade experience, fueled by stirring music and stunning (for the time) graphics.\n\n*1000cc Turbo* isn't just about speed; it's about skill. Master the handling of your chosen bike, dodging obstacles and strategically overtaking rivals to claim the top spot.  The variety of bikes offers distinct handling characteristics, adding depth to the gameplay.  Expect addictive, fast-paced action as you push your reflexes to the limit.  Can you conquer the competition and become the ultimate motorbike champion?  Rev your engines and find out!"
    },
